## 9. MVP Scope Checklist (build in this order)

1. Lobby: 4 players join a room.
2. Deal + hit/stand loop with correct blackjack scoring, no items yet.
3. Dealer auto-resolve + ranking + tie-break by card count.
4. Roulette check on lowest finisher, permanent elimination.
5. Match end + victory screen + restart.
6. Item: **Redraw** first (simplest, no targeting).
7. Item: **Shield** (passive, consumed on roulette trigger).
8. Item: **Peek**.
9. Items: **Force Hit**, **Card Swap** (targeting UI needed).
10. Roulette check animation polish (R3F scene).
11. Visual pass using the color/typography system in §7.

Do not build past step 5 without playtesting — steps 1–5 alone are enough to test the success metric in §3 with plain "does the swing of ranking + roulette feel tense" before items add complexity.